    {
      "path": "/summary",
      "value": "Detail-oriented and dedicated AML/KYC Analyst with 15 months of experience in client onboarding. Cross-trained in the UK, Malaysia, and default regions, with hands-on experience onboarding clients globally (excluding EU and sanctioned countries). Well-versed in verifying various types of Proof of Identity (POI) and Proof of Address (POA) documents across multiple jurisdictions. Skilled in using Onfido, LexisNexis, SAMS (Solytics Partners), and WealthKernel for customer due diligence and regulatory screening. Also responsible for resolving onboarding-related customer queries escalated via the support team. Certified in Investment Banking Operations from Imarticus Learning, with a B.Com degree, strong analytical and communication skills, and proficiency in Excel functions like VLOOKUP. Experienced with transaction monitoring and identifying suspicious activities. Utilizes data analysis and regulatory knowledge to ensure compliance and mitigate risks. Track record of enhancing anti-money laundering measures and improving overall transaction security.",
